        "    --- PASS: TestCOREFixtures/core-invalid-initial-repair \\(.*\\)$",
        "    --- PASS: TestCOREFixtures/core-invalid-initial-no-repair \\(.*\\)$",
        "    --- PASS: TestCOREFixtures/core-initializer-failed \\(.*\\)$",
